#. fr: Accélération
#. column 1: Next <if ($gn68 == 35)><if ($gn72 >= 82)><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Verthunder III</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Veraero III</ui-edge-color></ui-color><else><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Verthunder</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Veraero</ui-edge-color></ui-color></if><else><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Verthunder</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Veraero</ui-edge-color></ui-color></if>, or <if ($gn68 == 35)><if ($gn72 >= 66)><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Impact</ui-edge-color></ui-color><else><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Scatter</ui-edge-color></ui-color></if><else><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Scatter</ui-edge-color></ui-color></if> can be cast immediately.<br>Potency of <if ($gn68 == 35)><if ($gn72 >= 66)><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Impact</ui-edge-color></ui-color><else><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Scatter</ui-edge-color></ui-color></if><else><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Scatter</ui-edge-color></ui-color></if> is increased, and <if ($gn68 == 35)><if ($gn72 >= 82)><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Verthunder III</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Veraero III</ui-edge-color></ui-color><else><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Verthunder</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Veraero</ui-edge-color></ui-color></if><else><ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Verthunder</ui-edge-color></ui-color> and <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Veraero</ui-edge-color></ui-color></if> trigger <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Verfire Ready</ui-edge-color></ui-color> or <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Verstone Ready</ui-edge-color></ui-color> respectively.
