msgid "Dive Ready"
msgstr "Готов к миражному прыжку"

#. ja: ミラージュダイブを実行できる状態。
#. de: <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Illusionssprung</ui-edge-color></ui-color> kann ausgeführt werden.
#. fr: Piqué mirage peut être utilisé.
#. column 0: Dive Ready
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
