#. ja: 猛毒
#. de: Giftpollen
#. fr: Poison violent
#. column 1: Deadly pollen has filled the lungs, causing damage over time.
msgctxt "Status:1507:0:0"
msgid "Pollen"
msgstr "Пыльца"

#. ja: 毒に冒された状態。ＨＰが徐々に失われる。
#. de: Giftige Pollen in deiner Lunge verursachen schrittweise Schaden.
#. fr: Des dégâts périodiques de poison sont subis.
#. column 0: Pollen
msgctxt "Status:1507:0:1"
msgid "Deadly pollen has filled the lungs, causing damage over time."
msgstr "Ядовитая пыльца заполняет лёгкие и постепенно отнимает HP."

