#. fr: Une perte momentanée de conscience empêche toute action.
#. column 0: Stun
msgctxt "Status:1522:0:1"
msgid "Unable to act."
msgstr "Вы потеряли сознание и не можете действовать."

#. ja: ヘイスト＋
#. de: Hast +
#. fr: Hâte +
#. column 1: Weaponskill cast time and recast time, spell cast time and recast time, and auto-attack delay are reduced. Effect cannot be nullified.
msgctxt "Status:1523:0:0"
msgid "Haste+"
msgstr "Ускорение+"

