#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Status:1902:0:1"
msgid "Able to execute <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Atonement</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
msgstr "Можно использовать <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Искупление</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: 幻影
#. de: Phantomgestalt
#. fr: Illusion
#. column 1: Without corporeal form.
msgctxt "Status:1903:0:0"
msgid "Phantasmal"
msgstr "Призрачный"

#. ja: 幻影で形作られた存在。
#. de: Nicht an eine physische Gestalt gebunden.
#. fr: Forme corporelle chimérique projetée par un sort d'illusion.
#. column 0: Phantasmal
msgctxt "Status:1903:0:1"
msgid "Without corporeal form."
msgstr "Вы лишены телесной формы."

#. ja: 光の解放
#. de: Entfesseltes Licht
#. fr: Lumière salvatrice
#. column 1: Unleashing the Light trapped within you in defiance of the Darkness. Damage dealt and HP recovery are increased.
msgctxt "Status:1904:0:0"
msgid "Light in the Dark"
msgstr "Свет во тьме"

#. ja: 自身に蓄積していた光の力を解放し、闇の力に反逆している状態。与ダメージとHP回復量が増加する。
#. de: Das in dir gesammelte Licht bricht aus dir heraus und widersetzt sich der allumfassenden Dunkelheit. Ausgeteilter Schaden und LP-Regeneration ist erhöht.
#. fr: Fait appel à la Lumière qui l'habite pour se rebeller contre les Ténèbres. Les dégâts infligés et le potentiel curatif des soins sont augmentés.
#. column 0: Light in the Dark
msgctxt "Status:1904:0:1"
msgid "Unleashing the Light trapped within you in defiance of the Darkness. Damage dealt and HP recovery are increased. "
msgstr "Вы высвобождаете заключённый в вас Свет, бросая вызов Тьме. Наносимый урон и восстановление HP повышены."

#. ja: 魔装着用
#. de: Magische Rüstung
#. fr: Peau de serpent
#. column 1: Combat capabilities are sharply enhanced by Gukumatz's power.
msgctxt "Status:1905:0:0"
msgid "Veil of Gukumatz"
msgstr "Покров Гукумаца"

#. ja: グクマッツを魔装として着用し、戦闘能力が大幅に強化された状態。
#. de: Kampfkraft ist aufgrund der magischen Rüstung von Gukumatz bedeutend verstärkt.
#. fr: L'union avec Gukumatz augmente grandement les compétences de combat.
#. column 0: Veil of Gukumatz
msgctxt "Status:1905:0:1"
msgid "Combat capabilities are sharply enhanced by Gukumatz's power."
msgstr "Сила Гукумаца значительно повышает боевые способности."

#. ja: パーフェクトインビジブル
#. de: Perfekte Unsichtbarkeit
#. fr: Invisibilité parfaite
#. column 1: Having severely restricted the flow of life-sustaining aether, your presence is concealed but you are subject to the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Fading Fast</ui-edge-color></ui-color>.
msgctxt "Status:1906:0:0"
msgid "Perfect Deception"
msgstr "Совершенный обман"

#. ja: 自らの命脈を絞り、気配を完全に遮断した状態。自身に「命脈負荷」を付与する。
#. de: Unterdrückt den eigenen Lebensäther und macht auch auf der nichtphysischen Ebene unaufspürbar.
#. fr: L'affaiblissement temporaire des fonctions vitales provoque une invisibilité totale, et inflige Fardeau de survie.
#. column 0: Perfect Deception
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Status:1906:0:1"
msgid "Having severely restricted the flow of life-sustaining aether, your presence is concealed but you are subject to the effect of <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Fading Fast</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."
msgstr "Вы резко ограничили поток жизненного эфира и скрыли своё присутствие, но на вас действует эффект <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Угасание</ui-edge-color></ui-color>."

#. ja: 身体高負荷
#. de: Körperliche Last
#. fr: Faix prodigieux
#. column 1: Overburdened body is unable to execute actions.
msgctxt "Status:1907:0:0"
msgid "Faded Out"
msgstr "Угасание"

#. ja: 身体に高負荷がかかり、一時的に行動できない状態。
#. de: Macht für kurze Zeit handlungsunfähig.
#. fr: Un lourd fardeau s'abat et empêche temporairement toute action.
#. column 0: Faded Out
msgctxt "Status:1907:0:1"
msgid "Overburdened body is unable to execute actions."
msgstr "Перегруженное тело временно не позволяет вам действовать."

#. ja: 拘束
#. de: Gefesselt
#. fr: Attache
#. column 1: Unable to execute actions.
msgctxt "Status:1908:0:0"
msgid "Fetters"
msgstr "Оковы"

#. ja: 行動できなくなった状態。
#. de: Ist handlungsunfähig.
#. fr: Toute action est impossible.
#. column 0: Fetters
msgctxt "Status:1908:0:1"
msgid "Unable to execute actions."
msgstr "Вы не можете действовать."

#. ja: アクション効果範囲拡大
#. de: Erweiterter Radius
#. fr: Aire d'effet augmentée
#. column 1: Area of effect for actions is expanded.
msgctxt "Status:1909:0:0"
msgid "Area of Influence Up"
msgstr "Увеличение области действия"

#. ja: アクションの効果範囲が拡大した状態。
#. de: Der Wirkungsradius von Kommandos ist erweitert.
#. fr: L'aire d'effet des actions est agrandie.
#. column 0: Area of Influence Up
msgctxt "Status:1909:0:1"
msgid "Area of effect for actions is expanded."
msgstr "Область действия умений увеличена."

#. ja: 竜の右眼
#. de: Rechtes Drachen<shy>auge
#. fr: Œil droit
#. column 1: Damage dealt is increased and all action direction requirements are nullified.
msgctxt "Status:1910:0:0"
msgid "Right Eye"
msgstr "Правое око"

#. ja: 与ダメージが上昇し、かつ方向指定条件のあるアクションをどの方向から実行しても成功させる状態。
#. de: Ausgeteilter Schaden ist erhöht. Richtungsbedingungen für Kommandos werden als erfüllt betrachtet.
#. fr: Les dégâts infligés sont augmentés et les actions directionnelles réussissent dans n'importe quelle position.
#. column 0: Right Eye
msgctxt "Status:1910:0:1"
msgid "Damage dealt is increased and all action direction requirements are nullified."
msgstr "Наносимый урон увеличен, а требования к направлению для умений отменены."

#. ja: アサイラム
#. de: Refugium
#. fr: Asile
#. column 1: A veil of succor is healing party members in the area.
msgctxt "Status:1911:0:0"
msgid "Asylum"
msgstr "Убежище"

#. ja: 範囲内のパーティメンバーを回復するエリアを発生させている状態。
#. de: Hält eine Zone aufrecht, in der Grup<shy>pen<shy>mit<shy>glieder LP regenerieren.
#. fr: Crée une aura bénéfique dans l'aire ciblée, qui soigne les équipiers.
#. column 0: Asylum
msgctxt "Status:1911:0:1"
msgid "A veil of succor is healing party members in the area."
msgstr "Исцеляющий покров восстанавливает HP участников отряда в области действия."

#. ja: アサイラム：効果
#. de: Refugium
#. fr: Asile
#. column 1: HP recovery via healing actions is increased.
msgctxt "Status:1912:0:0"
msgid "Asylum"
msgstr "Убежище"

#. ja: 自身に対するＨＰ回復効果を向上させる状態。
#. de: Eigene LP-Regeneration durch Heilmagie ist erhöht.
#. fr: Les effets de récupération de PV sont augmentés.
#. column 0: Asylum
msgctxt "Status:1912:0:1"
msgid "HP recovery via healing actions is increased."
msgstr "Восстановление HP целительными умениями усилено."

#. ja: ヴァウスリーの祝福
#. de: Vauthrys Segnung
#. fr: Bénédiction de Vauthry
#. column 1: Blessed by Vauthry and experiencing heightened senses.
msgctxt "Status:1913:0:0"
msgid "Vauthry's Blessing"
msgstr "Благословение Ваутри"

#. ja: ドン・ヴァウスリーの祝福を受け、強化された状態。
#. de: Von Vauthrys Segnung gestärkt.
#. fr: Les sens sont aiguisés par la grâce de Vauthry.
#. column 0: Vauthry's Blessing
msgctxt "Status:1913:0:1"
msgid "Blessed by Vauthry and experiencing heightened senses."
msgstr "Благословение Ваутри обостряет ваши чувства."

#. ja: ディセムボウル
#. de: Drachengriff
#. fr: Éventration
#. column 1: Damage dealt is increased.
msgctxt "Status:1914:0:0"
msgid "Disembowel"
msgstr "Пробивание"

#. ja: 与ダメージが上昇した状態。
#. de: Ausgeteilter Schaden ist erhöht.
#. fr: Les dégâts infligés sont augmentés.
#. column 0: Disembowel
msgctxt "Status:1914:0:1"
msgid "Damage dealt is increased."
msgstr "Наносимый урон увеличен."

#. ja: アクション実行待機I
#. de: Egi-Attacke I
#. fr: Action en attente<nbsp>: 1
#. column 1: Pet has been issued an action command.
msgctxt "Status:1915:0:0"
msgid "Summon Order"
msgstr "Приказ призыва"

#. ja: ペットがアクション実行指示を受けた状態。
#. de: Führt eine befehligte Fähigkeit aus.
#. fr: Le familier a reçu l'ordre d'exécuter une action.
#. column 0: Summon Order
msgctxt "Status:1915:0:1"
msgid "Pet has been issued an action command."
msgstr "Питомец получил приказ применить умение."

#. ja: アート・オブ・エレメンタル
#. de: Name der Elemente
#. fr: Nom des éléments
#. column 1: Efficiency of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Brand of the Elements</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is increased.
msgctxt "Status:1916:0:0"
msgid "Name of the Elements"
msgstr "Имя стихий"

#. ja: 「ブランド・オブ・エレメンタル」の効率がアップした状態。
#. de: Effizienz von <ui-color 502><ui-edge-color 503>Zeichen der Elemente</ui-edge-color></ui-color> ist erhöht.
#. fr: L'efficacité de Marque des éléments est augmentée.
#. column 0: Name of the Elements
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "Status:1916:0:1"
msgid "Efficiency of <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Brand of the Elements</ui-edge-color></ui-color> is increased."
msgstr "Эффективность умения <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Клеймо элементов</ui-edge-color></ui-color> повышена."

#. ja: セラフィックヴェール
#. de: Schleier der Seraphim
#. fr: Voile séraphique
#. column 1: A holy barrier is nullifying damage.
msgctxt "Status:1917:0:0"
msgid "Seraphic Veil"
msgstr "Покров Серафима"

#. ja: 一定量のダメージを軽減する状態。
#. de: Erlittener Schaden ist um einen bestimmten Betrag verringert.
#. fr: Insensible à un certain montant de dégâts.
#. column 0: Seraphic Veil
msgctxt "Status:1917:0:1"
msgid "A holy barrier is nullifying damage."
msgstr "Священный барьер поглощает урон."

#. ja: 激励
#. de: Katalyse
#. fr: Exhortation
#. column 1: A magicked barrier is nullifying damage.
msgctxt "Status:1918:0:0"
